#: src/std-traits/comparisons.md
msgid ""
"These traits support comparisons between values. All traits can be derived "
"for types containing fields that implement these traits."
msgstr ""
"これらのトレイトは値の比較をサポートします。すべてのトレイトは、これらのトレ"
